   3.997476411629702*^9, 
   3.997476411896677*^9}},ExpressionUUID->"07579ac7-396d-47b2-ab27-\
32a0104a4cba"],

Cell["\<\
The 1D-MATH-TD test suite verifies that the internal functions responsible \
for constructing parameter time derivatives strictly match the analytical \
equations of motion governing the wavepacket\[CloseCurlyQuote]s evolution. \
Furthermore, the suite proves that the external potential energy and force \
functions correctly reproduce the underlying quadratic model, ensuring that \
they remain mathematically consistent with one another across successive \
spatial derivatives.\
\>", "Text",
 CellChangeTimes->{
  3.996755396194168*^9, {3.9974612165637083`*^9, 
   3.997461218567966*^9}},ExpressionUUID->"00cb124a-4533-4920-bfc3-\
2e6ffdc822c6"],

